bly <highlight>Tel Abu Kudeis</highlight> [<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Survey')\">Survey<sup>WP i. 69</sup></lookup>], approximately 2 miles southeast from <highlight>Lejjun</highlight> (<highlight>Megiddo</highlight>): compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 209.</sup></lookup> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <grk>Καδης</grk>: in southern Judah; <ref ref=\"Josh 15:23\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,23)\">Josh 15:23</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) (= II. <bdbheb>קָדֵשׁ</bdbheb> <b>1</b> ? if so, then Masoretic distinction from <bdbheb>קֶדֶשׁ</bdbheb> in the north was here neglected). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Josh 20:7", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 20, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Josh 21:32", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 21, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:61", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 61}, {"raw": "Josh 19:37", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 19, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Judg 4:6", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Josh 12:22", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 12, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Judg 4:9", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Judg 4:10", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Judg 4:11", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 4, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "2Kgs 15:29", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 15, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:57", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 57}, {"raw": "Josh 21:28", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 21, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Josh 15:23", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 15, "verse": 23}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["קֶ֫דֶשׁ", "נַפְתָּלִי", "׳", "ק", "קֶדֶשׁ", "קִשְׁיוֺן", "קָדֵשׁ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["Καδης", "Κεδες"], "translit": ["†idši", "†dšë"], "abbreviations": ["Buhl", "D", "GFM", "P", "Rob", "Survey", "WMM"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB7326", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}